# Copied into build/web. Cloudflare (Workers static assets or Pages) and Netlify read it; other
# hosts need the same headers set by hand (D-196).
#
# Cross-origin isolation lets the WebAssembly build run its renderer on several threads.
# credentialless (not require-corp) so images from other sites still load, just without cookies.
# Every sign-in on web is a redirect or a new tab that the app polls, so same-origin is safe.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
